# 游戏代理

# Paradox game artwork and mods web application assets; valid transfers favor proxies.
# https://api.paradox-interactive.com/mods/games
DOMAIN,metadata-assets.paradox-interactive.com
DOMAIN,mods.paradoxplaza.com

# Paradox public website and installer distribution entry point.
# https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/our-games/launcher
DOMAIN,www.paradoxinteractive.com
DOMAIN,www\.paradoxinteractive.com
DOMAIN,launcher.paradoxinteractive.com

# cpatch distribution CDN observed during launcher updates; retain the proxy path.
# Root requests return 403; they are not valid patch-download performance samples.
DOMAIN,distribution-fastly-prod.paradox-interactive.com

# Fallout Wiki image assets; access challenges prevent a valid direct-download benchmark.
DOMAIN,images.fallout.wiki

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steamcommunity.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steam-chat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,s.team
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steam.tv
# Steam 主站走代理（api 走直连，见 GameDirect.list）
DOMAIN,steampowered.com
DOMAIN,www.steampowered.com
DOMAIN,store.steampowered.com
DOMAIN,help.steampowered.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sonyentertainmentnetwork.com
